msgid "Further examples::"
msgstr "Daljnji primjeri::"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:39
msgid ""
"*Note:* Timer(1) is used for the camera.  Similarly, Timer(5) controls the "
"servo driver, and Timer(6) is used for timed ADC/DAC reading/writing.  It is"
" recommended to use the other timers in your programs."
msgstr ""
"*Napomena:* Timer(1) se koristi za kameru. Slično, Timer(5) upravlja pogonom"
" servomotora, a Timer(6) se koristi za vremenski upravljano čitanje/pisanje "
"ADC/DAC. Preporučuje se da u svojim programima koristite ostale mjerače "
"vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:43
msgid ""
"*Note:* Memory can't be allocated during a callback (an interrupt) and so "
"exceptions raised within a callback don't give much information.  See "
":func:`micropython.alloc_emergency_exception_buf` for how to get around this"
" limitation."
msgstr ""
"*Napomena:* Memorija se ne može alocirati tijekom povratnog poziva "
"(prekida), pa iznimke podignute unutar povratnog poziva ne daju mnogo "
"informacija. Pogledajte :func:`micropython.alloc_emergency_exception_buf` za"
" način kako zaobići ovo ograničenje."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:50
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:54
msgid ""
"Construct a new timer object of the given id.  If additional arguments are "
"given, then the timer is initialised by ``init(...)``. The set of valid "
"``id`` values depends on the STM32 MCU on the OpenMV Cam in use; consult the"
" STM32 reference manual for the available general-purpose and advanced-"
"control timers."
msgstr ""
"Konstruira novi objekt mjerača vremena s danim id. Ako su navedeni dodatni "
"argumenti, mjerač vremena se inicijalizira pozivom ``init(...)``\\ . Skup "
"valjanih ``id`` vrijednosti ovisi o STM32 MCU-u na korištenoj OpenMV Cam; "
"pogledajte STM32 referentni priručnik za dostupne mjerače vremena opće "
"namjene i napredne kontrole."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:61
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:65
msgid ""
"Initialise the timer.  Initialisation must be either by frequency (in Hz) or"
" by prescaler and period::"
msgstr ""
"Inicijalizira mjerač vremena. Inicijalizacija se mora obaviti ili putem "
"frekvencije (u Hz) ili putem preddjelitelja i perioda::"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:71 ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:159
msgid "Keyword arguments:"
msgstr "Ključni argumenti:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:73
msgid ""
"``freq`` --- specifies the periodic frequency of the timer. You might also "
"view this as the frequency with which the timer goes through one complete "
"cycle."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` --- određuje periodičku frekvenciju mjerača vremena. Možete je "
"također promatrati kao frekvenciju kojom mjerač vremena prolazi kroz jedan "
"potpuni ciklus."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:76
msgid ""
"``prescaler`` [0-0xffff] - specifies the value to be loaded into the timer's"
" Prescaler Register (PSC). The timer clock source is divided by ``(prescaler"
" + 1)`` to derive the timer clock. The clock source comes from the timer's "
"parent APB bus and is **MCU-dependent**. On STM32, timers on APB1 typically "
"clock at ``2 * pclk1`` and timers on APB2 at ``2 * pclk2``; read the current"
" bus frequencies with :func:`pyb.freq` and consult the STM32 reference "
"manual for your OpenMV Cam's MCU."
msgstr ""
"``prescaler`` [0-0xffff] - određuje vrijednost koja se učitava u registar "
"preddjelitelja mjerača vremena (PSC). Izvor takta mjerača vremena dijeli se "
"s ``(prescaler + 1)`` kako bi se dobio takt mjerača vremena. Izvor takta "
"dolazi s nadređene APB sabirnice mjerača vremena i **ovisi o MCU-u**\\ . Na "
"STM32, mjerači vremena na APB1 obično rade na taktu ``2 * pclk1``\\ , a oni "
"na APB2 na ``2 * pclk2``\\ ; očitajte trenutne frekvencije sabirnica pomoću "
":func:`pyb.freq` i pogledajte STM32 referentni priručnik za MCU vaše OpenMV "
"Cam."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:85
msgid ""
"``period`` [0-0xffff] for timers 1, 3, 4, and 6-15. [0-0x3fffffff] for "
"timers 2 & 5. Specifies the value to be loaded into the timer's AutoReload "
"Register (ARR). This determines the period of the timer (i.e. when the "
"counter cycles). The timer counter will roll-over after ``period + 1`` timer"
" clock cycles."
msgstr ""
"``period`` [0-0xffff] za mjerače vremena 1, 3, 4 i 6-15. [0-0x3fffffff] za "
"mjerače vremena 2 i 5. Određuje vrijednost koja se učitava u registar "
"automatskog ponovnog učitavanja mjerača vremena (ARR). Time se određuje "
"period mjerača vremena (tj. kada brojač završi ciklus). Brojač mjerača "
"vremena prijeći će preko maksimuma nakon ``period + 1`` taktnih ciklusa "
"mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:91 ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:161
msgid "``mode`` can be one of:"
msgstr "``mode`` može biti jedan od:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:93
msgid "``Timer.UP`` - configures the timer to count from 0 to ARR (default)"
msgstr ""
"``Timer.UP`` - konfigurira mjerač vremena za brojanje od 0 do ARR (zadano)"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:94
msgid "``Timer.DOWN`` - configures the timer to count from ARR down to 0."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.DOWN`` - konfigurira mjerač vremena za brojanje od ARR prema dolje "
"do 0."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:95
msgid ""
"``Timer.CENTER`` - configures the timer to count from 0 to ARR and then back"
" down to 0."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.CENTER`` - konfigurira mjerač vremena za brojanje od 0 do ARR i "
"zatim natrag do 0."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:98
msgid ""
"``div`` can be one of 1, 2, or 4. Divides the timer clock to determine the "
"sampling clock used by the digital filters."
msgstr ""
"``div`` može biti 1, 2 ili 4. Dijeli takt mjerača vremena kako bi se odredio"
" takt uzorkovanja koji koriste digitalni filtri."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:101
msgid "``callback`` - as per Timer.callback()"
msgstr "``callback`` - kao i Timer.callback()"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:103
msgid ""
"``deadtime`` - specifies the amount of \"dead\" or inactive time between "
"transitions on complementary channels (both channels will be inactive for "
"this time). ``deadtime`` may be an integer between 0 and 1008, with the "
"following restrictions: 0-128 in steps of 1. 128-256 in steps of 2, 256-512 "
"in steps of 8, and 512-1008 in steps of 16. ``deadtime`` measures ticks of "
"``source_freq`` divided by ``div`` clock ticks. ``deadtime`` is only "
"available on timers 1 and 8."
msgstr ""
"``deadtime`` - određuje količinu \"mrtvog\" ili neaktivnog vremena između "
"prijelaza na komplementarnim kanalima (oba kanala bit će neaktivna tijekom "
"tog vremena). ``deadtime`` može biti cijeli broj između 0 i 1008, uz "
"sljedeća ograničenja: 0-128 u koracima od 1, 128-256 u koracima od 2, "
"256-512 u koracima od 8 i 512-1008 u koracima od 16. ``deadtime`` mjeri "
"otkucaje ``source_freq`` podijeljene s ``div`` taktnih otkucaja. "
"``deadtime`` je dostupan samo na mjeračima vremena 1 i 8."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:111
msgid ""
"``brk`` - specifies if the break mode is used to kill the output of the PWM "
"when the ``BRK_IN`` input is asserted. The value of this argument determines"
" if break is enabled and what the polarity is, and can be one of "
"``Timer.BRK_OFF``, ``Timer.BRK_LOW`` or ``Timer.BRK_HIGH``. To select the "
"``BRK_IN`` pin construct a Pin object with ``mode=Pin.ALT, "
"alt=Pin.AFn_TIMx``. The pin's GPIO input features are available in alt mode "
"- ``pull=`` , ``value()`` and ``irq()``."
msgstr ""
"``brk`` - određuje koristi li se prekidni način rada (break) za prekidanje "
"izlaza PWM-a kada se aktivira ulaz ``BRK_IN``\\ . Vrijednost ovog argumenta "
"određuje je li prekid omogućen i koji je njegov polaritet, a može biti "
"``Timer.BRK_OFF``\\ , ``Timer.BRK_LOW`` ili ``Timer.BRK_HIGH``\\ . Za odabir"
" pina ``BRK_IN`` konstruirajte Pin objekt s ``mode=Pin.ALT, "
"alt=Pin.AFn_TIMx``\\ . Značajke GPIO ulaza pina dostupne su u alt načinu "
"rada - ``pull=`` , ``value()`` i ``irq()``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:119
msgid "``hard`` can be one of:"
msgstr "``hard`` može biti jedan od:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:121
msgid ""
"``True`` - The callback will be executed in hard interrupt context, which "
"minimises delay and jitter but is subject to the limitations described in "
":ref:`isr_rules` including being unable to allocate on the heap."
msgstr ""
"``True`` - Povratni poziv izvršit će se u kontekstu tvrdog prekida, što "
"minimizira kašnjenje i podrhtavanje (jitter), ali podliježe ograničenjima "
"opisanima u :ref:`isr_rules`\\ , uključujući nemogućnost alociranja na hrpi "
"(heap)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:125
msgid ""
"``False`` - The callback will be scheduled as a soft interrupt, allowing it "
"to allocate but possibly also introducing garbage-collection delays and "
"jitter."
msgstr ""
"``False`` - Povratni poziv bit će zakazan kao meki prekid, što mu omogućuje "
"alociranje, ali možda i unosi kašnjenja zbog sakupljanja smeća (garbage "
"collection) te podrhtavanje (jitter)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:129
msgid "The default value of this option is True."
msgstr "Zadana vrijednost ove opcije je True."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:131
msgid "You must either specify freq or both of period and prescaler."
msgstr "Morate navesti ili freq ili oboje, period i prescaler."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:135
msgid "Deinitialises the timer."
msgstr "Deinicijalizira mjerač vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:137
msgid "Disables the callback (and the associated irq)."
msgstr "Onemogućuje povratni poziv (i pridruženi irq)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:139
msgid ""
"Disables any channel callbacks (and the associated irq). Stops the timer, "
"and disables the timer peripheral."
msgstr ""
"Onemogućuje sve povratne pozive kanala (i pridružene irq). Zaustavlja mjerač"
" vremena i onemogućuje periferiju mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:144
msgid ""
"Set the function to be called when the timer triggers. ``fun`` is passed 1 "
"argument, the timer object. If ``fun`` is ``None`` then the callback will be"
" disabled."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja funkciju koja se poziva kada mjerač vremena okine. ``fun`` se "
"predaje 1 argument, objekt mjerača vremena. Ako je ``fun`` jednak ``None``\\"
" , povratni poziv bit će onemogućen."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:150
msgid ""
"If only a channel number is passed, then a previously initialized channel "
"object is returned (or ``None`` if there is no previous channel)."
msgstr ""
"Ako se proslijedi samo broj kanala, vraća se prethodno inicijalizirani "
"objekt kanala (ili ``None`` ako prethodni kanal ne postoji)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:153
msgid "Otherwise, a TimerChannel object is initialized and returned."
msgstr "U suprotnom, inicijalizira se i vraća TimerChannel objekt."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:155
msgid ""
"Each channel can be configured to perform pwm, output compare, or input "
"capture. All channels share the same underlying timer, which means that they"
" share the same timer clock."
msgstr ""
"Svaki kanal može se konfigurirati za izvođenje pwm-a, izlazne usporedbe "
"(output compare) ili ulaznog hvatanja (input capture). Svi kanali dijele "
"isti temeljni mjerač vremena, što znači da dijele isti takt mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:163
msgid "``Timer.PWM`` --- configure the timer in PWM mode (active high)."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.PWM`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u PWM načinu rada (aktivno "
"visoko)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:164
msgid ""
"``Timer.PWM_INVERTED`` --- configure the timer in PWM mode (active low)."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.PWM_INVERTED`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u PWM načinu rada "
"(aktivno nisko)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:165
msgid "``Timer.OC_TIMING`` --- indicates that no pin is driven."
msgstr "``Timer.OC_TIMING`` --- označava da se nijedan pin ne pobuđuje."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:166
msgid ""
"``Timer.OC_ACTIVE`` --- the pin will be made active when a compare match "
"occurs (active is determined by polarity)"
msgstr ""
"``Timer.OC_ACTIVE`` --- pin će postati aktivan kada dođe do podudaranja "
"usporedbe (aktivno je određeno polaritetom)"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:167
msgid ""
"``Timer.OC_INACTIVE`` --- the pin will be made inactive when a compare match"
" occurs."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.OC_INACTIVE`` --- pin će postati neaktivan kada dođe do podudaranja "
"usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:168
msgid ""
"``Timer.OC_TOGGLE`` --- the pin will be toggled when a compare match occurs."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.OC_TOGGLE`` --- pin će se preklopiti kada dođe do podudaranja "
"usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:169
msgid ""
"``Timer.OC_FORCED_ACTIVE`` --- the pin is forced active (compare match is "
"ignored)."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.OC_FORCED_ACTIVE`` --- pin se prisilno postavlja u aktivno stanje "
"(podudaranje usporedbe se zanemaruje)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:170
msgid ""
"``Timer.OC_FORCED_INACTIVE`` --- the pin is forced inactive (compare match "
"is ignored)."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.OC_FORCED_INACTIVE`` --- pin se prisilno postavlja u neaktivno "
"stanje (podudaranje usporedbe se zanemaruje)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:171
msgid "``Timer.IC`` --- configure the timer in Input Capture mode."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.IC`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u načinu rada ulaznog hvatanja "
"(Input Capture)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:172
msgid ""
"``Timer.ENC_A`` --- configure the timer in Encoder mode. The counter only "
"changes when CH1 changes."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.ENC_A`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u načinu rada enkodera. "
"Brojač se mijenja samo kada se promijeni CH1."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:173
msgid ""
"``Timer.ENC_B`` --- configure the timer in Encoder mode. The counter only "
"changes when CH2 changes."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.ENC_B`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u načinu rada enkodera. "
"Brojač se mijenja samo kada se promijeni CH2."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:174
msgid ""
"``Timer.ENC_AB`` --- configure the timer in Encoder mode. The counter "
"changes when CH1 or CH2 changes."
msgstr ""
"``Timer.ENC_AB`` --- konfigurira mjerač vremena u načinu rada enkodera. "
"Brojač se mijenja kada se promijeni CH1 ili CH2."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:176
msgid "``callback`` - as per TimerChannel.callback()"
msgstr "``callback`` - kao i TimerChannel.callback()"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:178
msgid ""
"``pin`` None (the default) or a Pin object. If specified (and not None) this"
" will cause the alternate function of the indicated pin to be configured for"
" this timer channel. An error will be raised if the pin doesn't support any "
"alternate functions for this timer channel."
msgstr ""
"``pin`` None (zadano) ili Pin objekt. Ako je naveden (i nije None), to će "
"uzrokovati konfiguriranje alternativne funkcije navedenog pina za ovaj kanal"
" mjerača vremena. Pojavit će se pogreška ako pin ne podržava nijednu "
"alternativnu funkciju za ovaj kanal mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:183
msgid "Keyword arguments for Timer.PWM modes:"
msgstr "Ključni argumenti za Timer.PWM načine rada:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:185
msgid "``pulse_width`` - determines the initial pulse width value to use."
msgstr ""
"``pulse_width`` - određuje početnu vrijednost širine impulsa koja će se "
"koristiti."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:186
msgid ""
"``pulse_width_percent`` - determines the initial pulse width percentage to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"``pulse_width_percent`` - određuje početni postotak širine impulsa koji će "
"se koristiti."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:188
msgid "Keyword arguments for Timer.OC modes:"
msgstr "Ključni argumenti za Timer.OC načine rada:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:190
msgid "``compare`` - determines the initial value of the compare register."
msgstr "``compare`` - određuje početnu vrijednost registra usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:192 ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:199
msgid "``polarity`` can be one of:"
msgstr "``polarity`` može biti jedan od:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:194
msgid "``Timer.HIGH`` - output is active high"
msgstr "``Timer.HIGH`` - izlaz je aktivno visok"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:195
msgid "``Timer.LOW`` - output is active low"
msgstr "``Timer.LOW`` - izlaz je aktivno nizak"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:197
msgid "Optional keyword arguments for Timer.IC modes:"
msgstr "Neobavezni ključni argumenti za Timer.IC načine rada:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:201
msgid "``Timer.RISING`` - captures on rising edge."
msgstr "``Timer.RISING`` - hvata na rastućem rubu."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:202
msgid "``Timer.FALLING`` - captures on falling edge."
msgstr "``Timer.FALLING`` - hvata na padajućem rubu."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:203
msgid "``Timer.BOTH`` - captures on both edges."
msgstr "``Timer.BOTH`` - hvata na oba ruba."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:205
msgid ""
"Note that capture only works on the primary channel, and not on the "
"complementary channels."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da hvatanje radi samo na primarnom kanalu, a ne na "
"komplementarnim kanalima."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:208
msgid "Notes for Timer.ENC modes:"
msgstr "Napomene za Timer.ENC načine rada:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:210
msgid ""
"Requires 2 pins, so one or both pins will need to be configured to use the "
"appropriate timer AF using the Pin API."
msgstr ""
"Zahtijeva 2 pina, pa će jedan ili oba pina trebati konfigurirati za "
"korištenje odgovarajuće AF mjerača vremena pomoću Pin API-ja."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:212
msgid "Read the encoder value using the timer.counter() method."
msgstr "Očitajte vrijednost enkodera pomoću metode timer.counter()."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:213
msgid "Only works on CH1 and CH2 (and not on CH1N or CH2N)"
msgstr "Radi samo na CH1 i CH2 (a ne na CH1N ili CH2N)"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:214
msgid "The channel number is ignored when setting the encoder mode."
msgstr "Broj kanala se zanemaruje pri postavljanju načina rada enkodera."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:216
msgid ""
"PWM example -- on every STM32 OpenMV Cam ``TIM4`` channels 1 and 2 are "
"routed to header pins ``P7`` and ``P8`` respectively::"
msgstr ""
"Primjer PWM-a -- na svakoj STM32 OpenMV Cam kanali 1 i 2 mjerača vremena "
"``TIM4`` usmjereni su na pinove zaglavlja ``P7`` odnosno ``P8``\\ ::"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:227
msgid "Get or set the timer counter."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja brojač mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:231
msgid ""
"Get or set the frequency for the timer (changes prescaler and period if "
"set)."
msgstr ""
"Dohvaća ili postavlja frekvenciju mjerača vremena (mijenja preddjelitelj i "
"period ako se postavi)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:235
msgid "Get or set the period of the timer."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja period mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:239
msgid "Get or set the prescaler for the timer."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja preddjelitelj mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:243
msgid "Get the frequency of the source of the timer."
msgstr "Dohvaća frekvenciju izvora mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:246
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:248
msgid "Counter-mode constants (``mode`` argument of :meth:`init`):"
msgstr "Konstante načina brojanja (\\ ``mode`` argument metode :meth:`init`\\ ):"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:253
msgid "Count from ``0`` up to ARR (the default mode)."
msgstr "Brojanje od ``0`` prema gore do ARR (zadani način rada)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:258
msgid "Count from ARR down to ``0``."
msgstr "Brojanje od ARR prema dolje do ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:263
msgid "Count from ``0`` up to ARR and then back down to ``0``."
msgstr ""
"Brojanje od ``0`` prema gore do ARR i zatim natrag prema dolje do ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:265
msgid "Break-mode constants (``brk`` argument of :meth:`init`):"
msgstr ""
"Konstante prekidnog načina rada (\\ ``brk`` argument metode :meth:`init`\\ "
"):"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:270
msgid "Break input is disabled."
msgstr "Prekidni ulaz je onemogućen."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:275
msgid "Break input is active-low."
msgstr "Prekidni ulaz je aktivno nizak."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:280
msgid "Break input is active-high."
msgstr "Prekidni ulaz je aktivno visok."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:282
msgid "Channel-mode constants (``mode`` argument of :meth:`channel`):"
msgstr ""
"Konstante načina rada kanala (\\ ``mode`` argument metode :meth:`channel`\\ "
"):"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:287
msgid "Configure the channel for PWM output (active high)."
msgstr "Konfigurira kanal za PWM izlaz (aktivno visoko)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:292
msgid "Configure the channel for PWM output (active low)."
msgstr "Konfigurira kanal za PWM izlaz (aktivno nisko)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:297
msgid "Output-compare timing mode; no pin is driven."
msgstr ""
"Način rada vremenskog usklađivanja izlazne usporedbe; nijedan pin se ne "
"pobuđuje."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:302
msgid "Output-compare active mode; the pin is made active on compare match."
msgstr ""
"Aktivni način rada izlazne usporedbe; pin postaje aktivan pri podudaranju "
"usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:307
msgid ""
"Output-compare inactive mode; the pin is made inactive on compare match."
msgstr ""
"Neaktivni način rada izlazne usporedbe; pin postaje neaktivan pri "
"podudaranju usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:312
msgid "Output-compare toggle mode; the pin toggles on compare match."
msgstr ""
"Preklopni način rada izlazne usporedbe; pin se preklapa pri podudaranju "
"usporedbe."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:317
msgid ""
"Output-compare forced-active mode; the pin is forced active and the compare "
"match is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Prisilno aktivni način rada izlazne usporedbe; pin se prisilno postavlja u "
"aktivno stanje, a podudaranje usporedbe se zanemaruje."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:323
msgid ""
"Output-compare forced-inactive mode; the pin is forced inactive and the "
"compare match is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Prisilno neaktivni način rada izlazne usporedbe; pin se prisilno postavlja u"
" neaktivno stanje, a podudaranje usporedbe se zanemaruje."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:329
msgid "Configure the channel for input-capture mode."
msgstr "Konfigurira kanal za način rada ulaznog hvatanja."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:334
msgid "Encoder mode: the counter only changes when CH1 changes."
msgstr "Način rada enkodera: brojač se mijenja samo kada se promijeni CH1."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:339
msgid "Encoder mode: the counter only changes when CH2 changes."
msgstr "Način rada enkodera: brojač se mijenja samo kada se promijeni CH2."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:344
msgid "Encoder mode: the counter changes whenever CH1 or CH2 changes."
msgstr ""
"Način rada enkodera: brojač se mijenja kad god se promijeni CH1 ili CH2."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:346
msgid ""
"Output-compare polarity (``polarity`` argument of :meth:`channel` in OC "
"modes):"
msgstr ""
"Polaritet izlazne usporedbe (\\ ``polarity`` argument metode :meth:`channel`"
" u OC načinima rada):"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:352
msgid "Output is active-high."
msgstr "Izlaz je aktivno visok."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:357
msgid "Output is active-low."
msgstr "Izlaz je aktivno nizak."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:359
msgid ""
"Input-capture polarity (``polarity`` argument of :meth:`channel` in IC "
"mode):"
msgstr ""
"Polaritet ulaznog hvatanja (\\ ``polarity`` argument metode :meth:`channel` "
"u IC načinu rada):"

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:365
msgid "Capture on the rising edge."
msgstr "Hvatanje na rastućem rubu."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:370
msgid "Capture on the falling edge."
msgstr "Hvatanje na padajućem rubu."

#: ../../library/pyb.Timer.rst:375
msgid "Capture on either edge."
msgstr "Hvatanje na bilo kojem rubu."
